shi-064-dukan-wife-wang","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","quote":"龕，僧辯婿也，始爲吳興太守，以陳武帝既非素貴，及爲之本郡，以法繩其宗門，無所縱舍。武帝銜之切齒。及僧辯敗，龕乃據吳興以拒之，頻敗陳文帝軍。龕好飲酒，終日恒醉，勇而無略，部將杜泰私通于文帝，説龕降文帝，龕然之。其妻王氏曰：「霸先讎隙如此，何可求和。」因出私財賞募，復大敗文帝軍。後杜泰降文帝，龕尚醉不覺，文帝遣人負出項王寺前斬之。王氏因截發出家，杜氏一門覆矣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0002","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","surface":"龕，僧辯婿也","start":0,"end":6}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"同段其妻王氏自發私財，後截發出家。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi024-wangqing-wife","subject_person_id":"g7w_9tv_iqb_A","object_person_id":"sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其妻王氏","nanshi024_wangqing_reading":"wife"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-064","source_id":"s-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang-ws1748895","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","quote":"龕，僧辯婿也，始爲吳興太守，以陳武帝既非素貴，及爲之本郡，以法繩其宗門，無所縱舍。武帝銜之切齒。及僧辯敗，龕乃據吳興以拒之，頻敗陳文帝軍。龕好飲酒，終日恒醉，勇而無略，部將杜泰私通于文帝，説龕降文帝，龕然之。其妻王氏曰：「霸先讎隙如此，何可求和。」因出私財賞募，復大敗文帝軍。後杜泰降文帝，龕尚醉不覺，文帝遣人負出項王寺前斬之。王氏因截發出家，杜氏一門覆矣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0106","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0100","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","surface":"其妻王氏","start":104,"end":108}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"妻指杜龕之妻。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanshi024-wangqing-w1-9","person_id":"sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA","title":"吳興太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanshi024-wangqing-w1-9:a","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","surface":"吳興太守","start":9,"en